[38;2;124;124;124mActually, let me recall more carefully:[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m- λ is the supremum of the writable ordinals. It is known that λ is a countable [0m[38;2;124;124;124mordinal.[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m- ζ is the supremum of eventually writable ordinals.[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m- Σ is the supremum of accidentally writable ordinals.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mThe relationships: λ < ζ < Σ, and these are all countable ordinals.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mIt's known that:[0m
