[38;2;124;124;124mWait, let me be more precise. The key results from Welch:[0m

[38;2;124;124;124m**Theorem (Welch)**: [0m
[38;2;124;124;124m- (λ, ζ, Σ) is the lexicographically least triple such that L_λ ≺_{Σ₁} L_ζ [0m
[38;2;124;124;124m≺_{Σ₂} L_Σ.[0m

