[38;2;124;124;124mAn ordinal α is Σ_n^1-reflecting if for every Σ_n^1 sentence φ, if L_α ⊨ φ then [0m[38;2;124;124;124mthere exists β < α such that L_β ⊨ φ.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mActually, the standard definition: α is Π_n^m-reflecting if for every Π_n^m [0m
